    "content": "@CoreFX We did a native injection of Volumetric Clouds into the game\n\n- They are now dont have any jitter on the edges of collision object\n- They render in reflections now\n- They render behind any kind of glass and transparent objects\n- They render behind any kind of particles\n- They render before motion blur, ingame depth of field and any kind of postfx effects\n\nNo visual change, just a shader migration. Same logic, same settings.\n\nEnhanced & Legacy",
